																								<script type="text/javascript">
							var StoreDefaults = {"PartnerEventStore":[{"gid":"667252863011916880","clan_steamid":"103582791475982697","event_name":"TRY IT Update: TRACE IT joins the collection!","event_type":12,"appid":5319610,"server_address":null,"server_password":null,"rtime32_start_time":1791800683,"rtime32_end_time":0,"comment_count":0,"creator_steamid":"0","last_update_steamid":"0","event_notes":"see announcement body","jsondata":"[]","announcement_body":{"gid":"667252863011916881","clanid":"46461289","posterid":"0","headline":"TRY IT Update: TRACE IT joins the collection!","posttime":1791800683,"updatetime":1791800683,"body":"Hi everyone!\n\nThis update adds a brand-new eighth game to TRY IT \u2014 TRACE IT!\n\n\n\ud83d\ude82 What is TRACE IT?\n\nA cozy paper-style train-track logic puzzle. The number beside each row and column tells you how many track pieces it holds. Use the numbers to lay one railway from the entrance to the exit. Every level has exactly one solution, and when the line is complete, the little train rolls out along your tracks.\n\nTRACE IT in TRY IT includes:\n\u2022 20 hand-picked levels with a gradual difficulty curve\n\u2022 A two-step tutorial you can skip anytime\n\u2022 No timer on the first level, so you can learn the rules first\n\u2022 Bronze, silver and gold medals\n\u2022 Two placement styles (radial dial or side buttons), and \u2715 marks can be drawn as trees and rocks\n\nIf you enjoy it, the full version of TRACE IT is coming soon to Steam with 500 levels plus Endless, Relax and Daily modes. Add it to your wishlist:\nhttps:\/\/store.steampowered.com\/app\/5398650\/TRACE_IT\/","commentcount":0,"tags":["patchnotes","mod_reviewed","ModAct_1425146861_1791801043_0"],"language":0,"hidden":0,"forum_topic_id":"592943924842118324","event_gid":"667252863011916880","voteupcount":2,"votedowncount":0,"ban_check_result":0,"banned":0},"published":1,"hidden":0,"rtime32_visibility_start":0,"rtime32_visibility_end":0,"broadcaster_accountid":0,"follower_count":0,"ignore_count":0,"forum_topic_id":"592943924842118324","rtime32_last_modified":1791973888,"news_post_gid":"0","rtime_mod_reviewed":1791801043,"featured_app_tagid":0,"referenced_appids":[],"build_id":0,"build_branch":"","unlisted":0,"rtime_created":1791800683,"votes_up":2,"votes_down":0,"comment_type":"ForumTopic","gidfeature":"592943924842118323","gidfeature2":"592943924842118324"}],"EventWebRowEmbed":{"bPreLoaded":true,"announcementGIDList":[],"last_update_event":{"rtime":1791800683,"event_gid":"667252863011916880","announcement_gid":"667252863011916881","clan_account_id":46461289}}};
						</script>
					

					<div data-featuretarget="events-row"></div>
				
								
				
				


								<div id="contentForThisGame_ctn">
				</div>
									<div data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}" id="aboutThisGame" class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 850px;">
						<div id="game_area_description" class="game_area_description">
							<h2>About This Game</h2>
							<p class="bb_paragraph" >Many puzzles, one place</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >TRY IT is a free collection of paper-style puzzle games. Warm beige paper, bold black lines, clean and satisfying controls — each game is a different logic puzzle with rules you'll get at a glance, and just enough depth to keep you thinking. New games will keep joining the collection.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Currently includes</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >• FILL IT: Split the board into rectangles. Each one holds exactly one number, and its area must equal that number.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >• Snip &amp; Fly: Cut the right ropes to free the tied-up birds — but be careful not to set the eagle loose too.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >• LIGHT IT: Place magic stones to light up every cell. Light travels in straight lines, stones may not light each other, and numbered walls tell you how many stones go around them.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >• LINK IT: Connect matching numbers with lines that never cross, and fill the whole board.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >• SUDOKU IT: Classic Sudoku. Fill 1 to 9 into every row, column and box. Jot down candidates with pencil marks, and use a hint when you're stuck.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >• LUCK IT: Plant one clover in every row, every column and every colored region. No two clovers may touch — not even diagonally.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >• PATH IT: Draw one stroke through every tile. The board gives no hints — even the starting point is yours to deduce.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Features</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >• Hand-picked levels in every game, with a gradual difficulty curve.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >• The first level has no timer, so you can learn the rules before the challenge begins.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >• Bronze, silver and gold medals: clear a level for bronze, finish with 50% or more time left for silver, 70% or more for gold.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >• Games with a tutorial let you open it from the menu anytime — and skip it anytime.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >• Multiple languages supported.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >• Completely free. No internet connection required.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Found your favorite?</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Every game in the collection has a full version on Steam with more levels and challenges. Press &quot;More challenges &amp; levels&quot; on the game select screen to go straight to its store page.</p>						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="game_page_autocollapse">
